   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past tense verbs",
     "texto": [
      "For many verbs, the singular past has a masculine form in **-ł** and a feminine form in **-ła**: **czytał/czytała** («read»).",
      "In the first person, **-łem** and **-łam** appear: **czytałem/czytałam** («I read»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Person and gender",
     "texto": [
      "The ending helps show who did the action: **pracowałem** is «I worked» said by a man and **pracowałam**, said by a woman.",
      "English does not show the speaker's gender in «I worked»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
